"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command your crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage, rescue, and hire crew members with unique skills and abilities. Every role is important for the survival of the ship and assigning the right crew member with the right talents is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336990/extras/6cc77f853ea0d0228b910d5ad3758efe.poster.avif?t=1750704072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336990/extras/6cc77f853ea0d0228b910d5ad3758efe.webm?t=1750704072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336990/extras/6cc77f853ea0d0228b910d5ad3758efe.mp4?t=1750704072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep each run new and exciting by exploring mysterious ruins and discovering powerful artifacts and loot. Combine their effects and the more artifacts you find, the more combinations and strategies become open to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336990/extras/550fe6c407f35fbdff69f120ab0301df.poster.avif?t=1750704072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336990/extras/550fe6c407f35fbdff69f120ab0301df.webm?t=1750704072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336990/extras/550fe6c407f35fbdff69f120ab0301df.mp4?t=1750704072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
